) VALUES (
  'images25-roast-me-caricature',
  'roast-me-caricature',
  'Roast-Me Caricature from a Photo',
  'Image Edits',
  $input$Comic-book caricature of a person built from three of their habits$input$,
  $p$Draw a caricature of the person in the attached photo in a bold comic-book style: thick confident ink outlines, flat cel colours, one hard shadow tone, slightly exaggerated head-to-body ratio.

Likeness first: keep their hair, face shape, skin tone, eyebrows and smile recognisable, only exaggerating the features that are already distinctive.

Three running jokes, shown as props rather than text: (1) an oversized double espresso cup held like a trophy, (2) a phone with an absurdly long unread-messages badge, (3) three sticky notes stuck to the forearm, each with a scribbled to-do, unreadable.

Pose: three-quarter view, mid-gesture as if explaining something at length. Background: a flat warm-ochre colour with a single halftone-dot burst behind the head. No speech bubbles, no words, no logos.$p$,
  $w$Caricature only works when the model knows what to exaggerate and what to keep, so the prompt lists the anchors of likeness and hands the humour to props. Props are safer than text: the model cannot misspell a coffee cup. Replace the three jokes with the person's real habits and keep the rest.$w$,
  'curated',
  ARRAY['image-edit', 'caricature', 'comic', 'humor', 'portrait', 'illustration']::text[],
  'gpt-image-2.5',
  'depikt_original',
  'Depikt',
  NULL,
  $n$Adapted from the 'roast me' caricature trend (TechRepublic, Sept 2026); prompt text is Depikt's.$n$,
  'approved',
  true,
  true,
  true,
  'identity',
  $r$Hair and smile against the source photo. Clearly the same person; comic ink style; all three props present; no text.
Outcome: Pass on attempt 1 (Sunburst high). Clear likeness with hair, brows and smile intact; espresso cup, phone with long red badge, three sticky notes on the forearm; halftone burst on ochre; no speech bubbles or words. Exaggeration is mild; add 'exaggerate more' if you want a harder caricature.
Model used: sunburst; attempts: 1.
Fixtures: portrait-full
Success: Clearly the same person; comic ink style; all three props present; no text.
Likely failure: Generic cartoon face with no likeness; words or speech bubbles added.
Check first: Hair and smile against the source photo.
Attempts: 2. Model: sunburst.
Reference inputs: A clear photo of the person's face.$r$,
  1,
  '/library/images-2-5/roast-me-caricature.webp',
  '2026-09-10T03:00:00.000Z',
  '2026-09-10T03:00:00.000Z'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET
